rt_hwstats_create", "summary": "Get hardware utilisation statistics", "description": "Returns CPU and memory utilisation per device for a given customer and date range.\n\n**Body parameters:**\n- `startDate` (required): Start date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format (e.g. `2026-04-01`)\n- `endDate` (required): End date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format (e.g. `2026-04-21`)\n- `customerName` (required): Customer CSS name (e.g. `acme-corp`)\n- `output` (optional): `xlsx` (default) or `json`.\n\n**Colour coding (xlsx output only):**\n- CPU / Memory **< 50 %** → green\n- CPU / Memory **50 – 70 %** → orange\n- CPU / Memory **> 70 %** → red\n\n**Example POST body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"startDate\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"endDate\": \"2026-04-21\",\n  \"customerName\": \"acme-corp\",\n  \"output\": \"xlsx\"\n}\n```\n\nIf `output` is not provided, response defaults to `xlsx`. Use `output=json` for JSON response.\n\n**Example JSON response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"hostname\": \"edge-site-01\",\n      \"datetime\": \"2026-04-01T08:00:00\",\n      \"cpu\": 23.5,\n      \"memory\": 61.2\n    },\n    {\n      \"hostname\": \"edge-site-02\",\n      \"datetime\": \"2026-04-01T08:00:00\",\n      \"cpu\": 45.1,\n      \"memory\": 78.9\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "parameters": [{"name": "data", "in": "body", "required": true, "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/HWStats"}}], "responses": {"201": {"description": "", "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/HWStats"}}}, "tags": ["v1"]}, "parameters": []}, "/report/licenses": {"post": {"operationId": "report_licenses_create", "description": "post function", "parameters": [{"name": "data", "in": "body", "required": true, "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}], "responses": {"201": {"description": "", "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}}, "tags": ["v1"]}, "parameters": []}, "/report/linkMetrics": {"post": {"operationId": "report_linkMetrics_create", "description": "post function", "parameters": [{"name": "data", "in": "body", "required": true, "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}], "responses": {"201": {"description": "", "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}}, "tags": ["v1"]}, "parameters": []}, "/report/linkStatistics": {"post": {"operationId": "report_linkStatistics_create", "description": "post method", "parameters": [{"name": "data", "in": "body", "required": true, "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}], "responses": {"201": {"description": "", "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}}, "tags": ["v1"]}, "parameters": []}, "/report/linksDownParser": {"post": {"operationId": "report_linksDownParser_create", "description": "post method", "parameters": [{"name": "data", "in": "body", "required": true, "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}], "responses": {"201": {"description": "", "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}}, "tags": ["v1"]}, "parameters": []}, "/report/lmac": {"post": {"operationId": "report_lmac_create", "description": "post method", "parameters": [{"name": "data", "in": "body", "required": true, "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}], "responses": {"201": {"description": "", "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}}, "tags": ["v1"]}, "parameters": []}, "/report/mds": {"post": {"operationId": "report_mds_create", "description": "post method", "parameters": [{"name": "data", "in": "body", "required": true, "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}], "responses": {"201": {"description": "", "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}}, "tags": ["v1"]}, "parameters": []}, "/report/msimLicense": {"post": {"operationId": "report_msimLicense_create", "description": "post method", "parameters": [{"name": "data", "in": "body", "required": true, "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}], "responses": {"201": {"description": "", "schema": {"$ref": "#/definitions/RAGenericInput"}}}, "tags": ["report"]}, "parameters": []}, "/report/objectgroups": {"post": {"o